@startuml
actor Admin
participant FE
participant UserSvc
database DB


Admin -> FE : Mở Quản lý người dùng
FE -> UserSvc : listUsers(filters)
UserSvc -> DB : SELECT users
DB --> UserSvc : rows
UserSvc --> FE : list
opt Thêm/Sửa/Xóa
Admin -> FE : Submit action
FE -> UserSvc : create/update/delete(...)
UserSvc -> DB : INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE
DB --> UserSvc : ok
UserSvc --> FE : success
end
@enduml